WEBVTT

00:02.507 --> 00:04.177
My name is Subaru Natsuki.

00:04.257 --> 00:07.477
And I am Milly's
Number One Knight.

00:07.557 --> 00:08.517
Hmm!

00:08.597 --> 00:09.887
[slashing]

00:09.977 --> 00:12.267
Aren't you getting
a little too comfortable?

00:12.357 --> 00:14.937
You can't just let your guard
down in the middle of a fight.

00:15.027 --> 00:16.357
[gasps]

00:16.437 --> 00:19.197
Then it's a good thing
I don't let my guard down.

00:19.277 --> 00:20.237
[thud]

00:20.317 --> 00:22.657
[groans]

00:22.737 --> 00:24.367
[whoosh]

00:24.447 --> 00:25.527
Damn it.

00:25.617 --> 00:27.287
- That bastard got away--
- Subaru!

00:27.367 --> 00:28.327
Whoa, whoa.

00:28.407 --> 00:30.117
Hold on a second, Milly.

00:30.207 --> 00:33.167
Your hair's so silky and soft,
and it smells so nice, too.

00:33.247 --> 00:34.627
New shampoo?

00:34.707 --> 00:37.337
Subaru, you're such a jerk,
a really huge jerk.

00:37.417 --> 00:38.917
I was so worried about you.

00:39.007 --> 00:40.587
You jerk, jerk, jerk!

00:40.677 --> 00:43.047
That's a heck of a lot
of "jerks" you just said.

00:43.137 --> 00:45.467
I mean, I can't really
argue either, but--

00:49.807 --> 00:51.767
Are you in one piece?

00:51.847 --> 00:52.937
Mm.

00:53.017 --> 00:54.227
You were still Subaru,

00:54.307 --> 00:56.107
even when you didn't
have your memories.

00:56.187 --> 00:57.817
And it wasn't very long.

00:57.897 --> 00:58.937
But you worked so--

00:59.027 --> 01:00.897
I know. It's OK.

01:00.987 --> 01:03.657
That Subaru is still
inside both of us,

01:03.737 --> 01:05.827
so he won't be
left behind at all.

01:05.907 --> 01:08.867
Everything's really,
truly OK, Milly.

01:08.947 --> 01:10.287
Yeah.

01:13.827 --> 01:18.377
[ringing]

01:21.257 --> 01:22.507
Found you.

01:24.137 --> 01:25.217
First things first.

01:25.297 --> 01:28.347
Let's go fetch
my adorable partner.

01:28.427 --> 01:32.267
[theme music]

01:32.347 --> 01:39.437
♪ ♪

02:58.267 --> 02:59.477
Beako!

02:59.557 --> 03:00.477
[EMILIA] Beatrice!

03:00.567 --> 03:02.147
Huh?

03:02.227 --> 03:04.737
Subaru is here with some
woman I've never seen before.

03:04.817 --> 03:06.277
Oh, Beas!

03:06.357 --> 03:09.367
Oh, Beako, you're so light
and easy to pick up.

03:09.447 --> 03:10.447
So cute.

03:10.527 --> 03:11.787
Look, Beatrice.

03:11.867 --> 03:14.197
Subaru can remember
everything now.

03:14.287 --> 03:15.247
Wait, I suppose.

03:15.327 --> 03:17.707
Wait, I said.

03:17.787 --> 03:21.207
So, Subaru, you really
remember everything, I suppose?

03:21.287 --> 03:23.417
You remember Betty,
as well as all the things

03:23.507 --> 03:24.507
we've been through together?

03:24.587 --> 03:25.587
All of it?

03:25.667 --> 03:27.297
Yeah, that's right.

03:27.377 --> 03:28.547
So don't look so worried.

03:28.637 --> 03:30.217
It's OK now.

03:30.297 --> 03:31.427
Besides...

03:33.967 --> 03:36.347
Uh, Big Sister?

03:37.807 --> 03:40.597
Well, it appears that
the snow has melted quickly.

03:40.687 --> 03:43.567
Leave it to Barasu to make
a fuss over nothing.

03:43.647 --> 03:45.777
It's time
for my long-awaited return.

03:45.857 --> 03:47.857
He who was born
of the snow melting,

03:47.947 --> 03:49.317
the man of spring, Subaru--

03:49.407 --> 03:50.447
[trilling]

03:50.527 --> 03:52.447
[thud]

03:52.527 --> 03:55.157
Looks like Patrasche is
also glad to see you're back.

03:55.247 --> 03:56.697
She really missed you.

03:56.787 --> 03:57.957
Oh, man.

03:58.037 --> 04:00.247
A tsundere reception
like this is rare.

04:00.327 --> 04:03.457
No, joking aside, I'm sorry
that I worried you, too.

04:03.537 --> 04:05.377
[trilling]

04:05.457 --> 04:09.127
But I should save
all the mushy stuff for later.

04:09.217 --> 04:11.337
- All right, let's do this.
- Wait.

04:11.427 --> 04:13.797
Before that, there's
something I want to ask.

04:13.887 --> 04:15.097
Oh.
Me, right?

04:15.177 --> 04:16.597
Sure.

04:16.677 --> 04:19.597
My name's Emilia, just Emilia.

04:19.687 --> 04:21.557
There's lots of things
I'd like to say,

04:21.647 --> 04:23.857
but you, me, and Beatrice,
we're all family

04:23.937 --> 04:26.227
working to accomplish
the same thing.

04:26.937 --> 04:28.107
Hold on.

04:28.197 --> 04:30.107
Did I say something
strange just now?

04:30.197 --> 04:33.947
There are many things
I'd like to verify, but later.

04:34.027 --> 04:35.407
It was Gluttony, right?

04:35.487 --> 04:38.077
I don't like simply
accepting defeat.

04:38.157 --> 04:40.117
I feel the very same way.

04:40.207 --> 04:42.417
We'll get it all back,
no matter what it takes.

04:42.497 --> 04:43.787
Yes, indeed.

04:43.877 --> 04:46.247
They'll pay 100-million
fold, I suppose.

04:46.337 --> 04:49.547
[chuckles] Man, I really
feel like I'm back home now.

04:50.877 --> 04:53.387
So that's what's going on
in the tower now.

04:53.467 --> 04:57.007
In other words, the specific
obstacles in front of us are--

04:57.097 --> 04:58.637
The two Gluttonies.

04:58.717 --> 05:01.017
The horde of mabeasts that
are attacking from outside.

05:01.097 --> 05:02.097
What else?

05:02.187 --> 05:03.727
And Shaula's attack as well.

05:03.807 --> 05:05.147
That's four obstacles.

05:05.227 --> 05:06.477
That's right.

05:08.397 --> 05:10.237
So that must have shown up
with the same reason

05:10.317 --> 05:12.607
it did at the Sanctuary,
because Rui was here,

05:12.697 --> 05:14.777
and she knows about
Return by Death.

05:14.867 --> 05:18.947
Now that she's gone, it
shouldn't come back, I think.

05:19.447 --> 05:20.367
Subaru?

05:20.447 --> 05:21.827
Oh, uh, sorry.

05:21.907 --> 05:23.077
What's wrong?

05:23.167 --> 05:25.327
You just looked
entirely flummoxed.

05:25.417 --> 05:27.837
No one really says
flummoxed anymore these days.

05:27.917 --> 05:31.217
[laughs] Subaru, can you
say that again one more time?

05:31.297 --> 05:32.677
Later, OK?

05:32.757 --> 05:34.177
Later.

05:34.257 --> 05:35.467
[clears throat]

05:35.547 --> 05:38.137
So, those are
the four obstacles left.

05:38.217 --> 05:40.597
We'll go as a group
and tackle them together.

05:40.677 --> 05:42.017
It's an all-out war.

05:42.097 --> 05:44.397
And for that, Ram--

05:46.147 --> 05:47.937
[shooting]

05:48.017 --> 05:51.397
[screeching]

05:51.487 --> 05:54.067
[groans]

05:54.147 --> 05:55.567
Hey, Shaula!

05:55.657 --> 05:57.827
No, someone's just--
someone's just

05:57.907 --> 05:59.827
broken one of the rules!

05:59.907 --> 06:01.327
[groans]

06:01.407 --> 06:02.407
This is bad.

06:02.497 --> 06:04.157
She's going to break.

06:04.247 --> 06:06.417
Meili, how are you faring?

06:06.497 --> 06:09.087
I kind of have my hands full.

06:09.957 --> 06:11.757
[SUBARU] Shaula!

06:11.837 --> 06:14.177
[pants]

06:16.007 --> 06:18.307
Ma-- Master?

06:22.137 --> 06:24.097
Master, please.

06:24.187 --> 06:25.387
Give me--

06:25.477 --> 06:28.357
give me the order
now, please!

06:28.437 --> 06:30.937
[groans]

06:31.027 --> 06:33.317
If you don't do it,
then I'll--

06:33.397 --> 06:35.567
[groans]

06:35.647 --> 06:36.777
Master!

06:38.367 --> 06:41.447
Like I keep on telling you,
don't give me so much power.

06:41.537 --> 06:43.907
There's no reason for you
to call me your master.

06:43.997 --> 06:45.367
[gasps]

06:46.827 --> 06:50.417
I'm not going to tell you
to kill yourself, OK?

06:50.497 --> 06:52.507
You waited for 400 years.

06:52.587 --> 06:54.547
I'm not letting
our reunion end in tears.

06:55.837 --> 06:59.047
Master, I love you!

07:00.097 --> 07:03.427
[creaking]

07:03.517 --> 07:07.137
[roaring]

07:09.807 --> 07:10.937
Ey!

07:11.017 --> 07:12.857
[thud]

07:16.277 --> 07:18.317
Hey, Meili.
Echidna.

07:18.407 --> 07:20.067
Natsuki,
are you feeling better?

07:20.157 --> 07:22.197
Wait, your memories are back.

07:22.277 --> 07:23.827
You catch on quickly.

07:23.907 --> 07:25.617
How were you able to tell?

07:25.697 --> 07:28.707
[ECHIDNA] The look on
Beatrice's face gave it away.

07:28.787 --> 07:30.167
Who is she?

07:30.247 --> 07:33.207
That is Gluttony's doing,
same as Julius, too.

07:33.297 --> 07:34.457
Her name's Emilia.

07:34.547 --> 07:36.047
Mm.

07:36.127 --> 07:37.627
Mm.

07:37.717 --> 07:39.337
Echidna, you head upstairs
and join up

07:39.427 --> 07:41.007
with Julius for now.

07:41.097 --> 07:43.887
I've already talked to Emilia
about what to do after.

07:43.967 --> 07:45.427
And what will you two do?

07:45.517 --> 07:47.517
Subaru and Betty will stay.

07:47.597 --> 07:50.357
We'll play with this giant
scorpion for a bit, I suppose.

07:50.437 --> 07:53.317
I don't intend
on doubting your plans now.

07:53.397 --> 07:54.897
So I'll obey.

07:54.977 --> 07:56.237
Do you have a message
for Julius?

07:56.317 --> 07:58.197
No, not particularly.

07:58.277 --> 08:01.027
I mean, it's Julius Juukulius
we're talking about here.

08:02.367 --> 08:04.827
Oh, there is one thing.

08:04.907 --> 08:07.247
"Everyone else is
struggling big time out here,

08:07.327 --> 08:09.537
so hurry up and finish your job
so you can lend them a hand."

08:09.617 --> 08:11.037
Got it.

08:11.127 --> 08:13.497
I'll be sure to pass that
along word-for-word, then.

08:15.877 --> 08:18.717
Now, just like we discussed,
you're the key here, Milly.

08:18.797 --> 08:20.757
Yeah. Got it.

08:20.837 --> 08:23.137
And don't you go dying
or anything, OK?

08:23.217 --> 08:24.637
I'll be fine.

08:26.347 --> 08:27.517
And me?

08:27.597 --> 08:29.597
What exactly
am I supposed to do now?

08:29.687 --> 08:31.977
Sorry, but you'll
be helping us, Meili.

08:32.057 --> 08:34.567
This team will be you,
me, and Beako.

08:34.647 --> 08:36.987
We're going to be handling
the mabeast stampede,

08:37.067 --> 08:38.647
and also, that big scorpion.

08:39.947 --> 08:41.317
Here it comes!

08:41.407 --> 08:43.157
[thud]

08:43.237 --> 08:44.987
[buzzing]

08:45.077 --> 08:46.447
Grab on!

08:46.537 --> 08:47.447
[galloping]

08:47.537 --> 08:50.867
[screaming]

08:54.287 --> 08:56.087
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa

08:56.167 --> 08:57.507
whoa, whoa, I say!

08:57.587 --> 08:59.467
I never thought
in a million years that you

08:59.547 --> 09:02.507
and I would be fighting
side-by-side like this one day!

09:02.587 --> 09:03.967
[laughs]

09:04.047 --> 09:05.927
[screeching]

09:06.007 --> 09:08.427
[roaring]

09:08.517 --> 09:09.767
Dodge it!

09:11.017 --> 09:12.387
[screaming]

09:12.477 --> 09:14.727
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

09:14.807 --> 09:16.357
[thud]

09:19.147 --> 09:21.987
[panting]
I don't feel alive right now.

09:22.067 --> 09:23.987
That was a big
waking nightmare.

09:24.067 --> 09:26.277
And that was only the start.

09:26.367 --> 09:29.497
[screeching]

09:29.577 --> 09:30.957
Let's do this.

09:31.037 --> 09:32.747
This fate-- no, wait.

09:32.827 --> 09:35.167
This tower's whole system
is going down.

09:36.377 --> 09:38.707
Ora ora ora ora ora!

09:38.797 --> 09:40.127
Do you really think
you can beat me

09:40.217 --> 09:43.297
if you keep going on like that,
bro?

09:43.377 --> 09:46.677
[groans]

09:46.757 --> 09:48.557
Ya!

09:48.637 --> 09:50.137
[EMILIA] That's enough.

09:50.227 --> 09:52.017
What now?

09:52.097 --> 09:53.977
[jingling]

09:54.057 --> 09:55.357
[whoosh]

09:55.437 --> 09:56.357
[ting]

09:56.437 --> 09:57.977
[cracking]

09:59.857 --> 10:01.237
Who the hell are you?

10:01.317 --> 10:04.237
You are stupid hot,
sexy as hell.

10:04.317 --> 10:07.027
I'd rather be up against you
than this loser.

10:07.117 --> 10:08.867
Sorry for interrupting.

10:08.947 --> 10:10.867
It's just,
we really need Julius

10:10.947 --> 10:12.457
to defeat you no matter what.

10:12.537 --> 10:14.117
For real?

10:14.207 --> 10:18.497
I know that you just saved me,
but Echidna, this girl--

10:18.587 --> 10:19.667
who is she?

10:19.747 --> 10:22.297
According to Natsuki,
it seems

10:22.377 --> 10:24.547
she's in the same
predicament as you are.

10:24.627 --> 10:25.887
Really?

10:25.967 --> 10:27.257
Yes, Julius.

10:27.347 --> 10:29.507
I know too well
just what you must have

10:29.597 --> 10:30.807
been feeling all this time.

10:30.887 --> 10:32.347
I see.

10:32.427 --> 10:33.557
So it's true, then.

10:33.637 --> 10:34.847
Hey, come on, now.

10:34.937 --> 10:36.897
What's your deal,
cutie patootie?

10:36.977 --> 10:40.227
For some reason, I have no urge
to reach out and stop you.

10:40.317 --> 10:42.357
Don't tell me
you've already managed

10:42.437 --> 10:44.187
to clear the exam somehow?

10:44.277 --> 10:45.527
Yes, that's right.

10:45.607 --> 10:47.117
You touched my chest
with your chopsticks

10:47.197 --> 10:48.157
and lost right after.

10:48.237 --> 10:49.827
Ha!

10:49.907 --> 10:51.867
Couldn't have asked for a more
fun way to lose, at least.

10:51.947 --> 10:54.707
But it's a damn shame
I don't remember it.

10:54.787 --> 10:56.497
Julius, sorry.

10:56.577 --> 10:58.037
Do what you must.

10:58.127 --> 11:00.337
Go on, beautiful one
whose name remains

11:00.417 --> 11:02.587
as lost to the world as mine.

11:02.667 --> 11:04.757
I wish you all the best.

11:04.837 --> 11:05.717
Thanks.

11:05.797 --> 11:07.007
You, too.

11:09.927 --> 11:11.967
[whoosh]

11:13.807 --> 11:15.557
And what are you
planning to do?

11:15.637 --> 11:18.057
Will you stay here
and observe my battle, or--

11:18.147 --> 11:19.307
Of course.

11:19.397 --> 11:21.477
If you'll allow it, that is.

11:21.567 --> 11:22.607
No, wait.

11:22.687 --> 11:25.277
I mean, that is what I'll do.

11:25.357 --> 11:28.067
I already determined that
for myself.

11:28.157 --> 11:29.867
Because--

11:29.947 --> 11:33.907
because, you are
Anastasia Hoshin's Knight,

11:33.997 --> 11:34.947
aren't you?

11:35.037 --> 11:36.617
Hmm.

11:36.707 --> 11:39.747
That gives me even more
strength than I expected.

11:39.827 --> 11:41.707
I may as well be a nobody.

11:41.787 --> 11:43.707
I am a stranger to you,
and yet still,

11:43.797 --> 11:45.967
you choose to place
your hopes in me

11:46.047 --> 11:47.967
out of pure faith.

11:48.047 --> 11:51.467
Julius, I have a message
for you.

11:51.547 --> 11:53.507
He said, "Hurry up
and finish your job

11:53.597 --> 11:55.177
so you can lend the rest
of them a hand."

11:55.267 --> 11:56.267
You know who.

11:56.347 --> 11:57.557
Ha.

11:57.637 --> 11:59.977
If he's already broken
out of his shell,

12:00.057 --> 12:02.227
then I mustn't lag behind him.

12:03.067 --> 12:05.487
[scoffs, chuckles]

12:05.567 --> 12:07.487
I'm Reid the Stick Swinger.

12:07.567 --> 12:12.197
Remember that name even
when you're eating the dirt.

12:12.277 --> 12:14.117
Then I shall do the same.

12:14.197 --> 12:16.617
My name is Julius Juukulius.

12:16.697 --> 12:20.167
I'm Miss Anastasia
Hoshin's Number One Knight.

12:20.247 --> 12:22.837
I shan't remain nameless.

12:22.917 --> 12:24.457
That ends now.

12:25.457 --> 12:28.337
[grunts]

12:28.417 --> 12:31.007
We can't seem to get
in touch with cute little Rui

12:31.087 --> 12:32.927
or even Roy for some reason.

12:33.007 --> 12:35.097
Oh, well. Life goes on.

12:35.177 --> 12:37.517
If they failed, it just means
we'll have to slurp up

12:37.597 --> 12:39.637
this whole meal ourselves.

12:39.727 --> 12:41.137
[RAM] How carefree of you.

12:41.227 --> 12:42.437
Huh?

12:42.517 --> 12:43.557
And do you really think
you've earned

12:43.647 --> 12:46.147
the right to be that way?

12:46.227 --> 12:47.937
From what I've heard,
you're the one

12:48.027 --> 12:51.197
who tore the sisterly love
between me and Rem to shreds.

12:51.277 --> 12:52.947
Hee.

12:54.237 --> 12:56.027
I'll make you squeal
like a pig as you die.

12:56.117 --> 12:57.037
[clanging]

12:57.117 --> 12:58.287
What's wrong with you?

12:58.367 --> 13:00.037
Having fun dancing
around like that?

13:00.117 --> 13:01.787
Are you?
Are you?

13:01.867 --> 13:03.247
Are you, bro?

13:04.877 --> 13:08.167
As your mood changes,
your sword goes along with it.

13:08.257 --> 13:11.507
So I've been expecting some
big explosion from you.

13:11.587 --> 13:14.547
Instead of that, you're gonna
lose because of your obsession

13:14.637 --> 13:15.717
with manners?

13:15.797 --> 13:16.967
Stupid.

13:17.057 --> 13:19.597
And you're satisfied
being that pathetic?

13:19.677 --> 13:21.767
All criticisms
you've shared before.

13:21.847 --> 13:23.597
But you truly don't
hold back, do you?

13:23.687 --> 13:25.937
[scoffs] Yeah, that figures.

13:26.017 --> 13:29.357
Ain't nothing to your sword
work but desperation.

13:29.437 --> 13:31.147
[grunts]

13:31.237 --> 13:33.197
You're always putting on
this whole polite,

13:33.277 --> 13:34.817
proper knight act.

13:34.907 --> 13:38.237
But on the inside, you're
just a stick swinger like me.

13:38.327 --> 13:40.617
I feel suffocated
just watching you.

13:40.707 --> 13:42.617
It's painful, bro.

13:42.707 --> 13:44.497
[music playing]

13:44.577 --> 13:45.707
I see.

13:47.037 --> 13:49.207
I think I finally understand.

13:49.297 --> 13:50.877
Huh?

13:50.967 --> 13:54.637
Why you are so relentless
with me compared to others.

13:54.717 --> 13:56.717
I must have something
that reminds you

13:56.797 --> 13:58.307
too much of yourself.

13:58.387 --> 14:00.637
Screw that
complicated bullshit.

14:00.727 --> 14:03.637
I only know what my instincts
tell me about you,

14:03.727 --> 14:05.607
that you'd be a hell
of a lot more interesting

14:05.687 --> 14:07.607
if you dropped the mask.

14:07.687 --> 14:09.777
And you know it, too,
I can tell.

14:09.857 --> 14:12.777
You're never gonna beat me if
you stay the way you are now.

14:12.857 --> 14:15.067
And you're never gonna
impress that gorgeous creature

14:15.157 --> 14:16.367
behind you, either!

14:16.447 --> 14:17.447
Ha!

14:17.527 --> 14:18.907
[boom]

14:18.987 --> 14:20.747
You are right about that.

14:20.827 --> 14:22.117
It's an act.

14:22.207 --> 14:24.497
But this is who
I've decided to become.

14:26.877 --> 14:29.207
What you say
is certainly accurate.

14:29.287 --> 14:31.757
Many of your statements
ring true.

14:31.837 --> 14:34.627
I am not a legitimate child
of the Juukulius family.

14:35.887 --> 14:38.507
In fact, I was born
to simple commoners.

14:38.597 --> 14:40.557
Before my current father
took me in,

14:40.637 --> 14:43.177
I had no knowledge
of noble culture.

14:43.267 --> 14:45.097
Who I am now,
my identity,

14:45.187 --> 14:46.897
is something I built
from the ground up.

14:46.977 --> 14:49.647
It's nothing but an ugly-ass
facade, though.

14:49.727 --> 14:51.187
While that may be true,

14:51.267 --> 14:54.567
perhaps my true self
is still that rustic boy

14:54.647 --> 14:56.357
who knew nothing of ideals.

14:57.237 --> 15:00.907
However, I met my ideal.

15:00.987 --> 15:02.327
[music playing]

15:02.407 --> 15:03.367
Huh?

15:03.447 --> 15:10.537
♪ ♪

15:14.467 --> 15:17.467
That is why
I will see this guise through

15:17.547 --> 15:19.677
and remain a knight.

15:19.757 --> 15:23.177
With my mask, I'll lock away
my original self.

15:24.387 --> 15:26.227
I will stand
with proper posture,

15:26.307 --> 15:28.807
clothes tidy, and put on
the appearance

15:28.897 --> 15:32.817
of the one I wish to be
through an ironclad will alone.

15:32.897 --> 15:35.437
That is the facade
I have chosen to wear,

15:35.527 --> 15:37.817
now and evermore.

15:37.897 --> 15:40.617
Many mock those
who put on such airs.

15:40.697 --> 15:42.277
But I truly believe
there are just as many

15:42.367 --> 15:44.617
who find such ostentation
to be

15:44.697 --> 15:47.037
a dazzling display of beauty.

15:47.117 --> 15:49.327
Those like me,
who have long aspired

15:49.417 --> 15:51.337
to live life as a knight.

15:51.417 --> 15:52.457
♪ ♪

15:52.537 --> 15:53.877
[gasps]

15:54.877 --> 15:55.967
Hmm.

15:58.507 --> 16:01.927
I apologize, precious buds.

16:02.007 --> 16:06.477
[chiming]

16:07.807 --> 16:11.017
The past me was terribly
afraid of change.

16:11.107 --> 16:14.267
I was pathetic and weak.

16:14.357 --> 16:16.857
But I relinquish
that cowardly self.

16:17.777 --> 16:21.447
My buds, I hereby set you free.

16:21.527 --> 16:23.617
Forgive me
for so desperately clinging on

16:23.697 --> 16:25.787
to our fractured bond.

16:25.867 --> 16:29.577
[ringing]

16:29.657 --> 16:32.247
But now, once more,

16:32.337 --> 16:34.537
I call upon you.

16:34.627 --> 16:36.667
I love you all.

16:36.757 --> 16:39.967
If you can accept this
vain pretender's advances,

16:40.047 --> 16:41.927
bond with me anew.

16:42.007 --> 16:43.967
I want you all by my side.

16:44.047 --> 16:45.757
Let us form a new contract.

16:45.847 --> 16:47.347
[ringing]

16:47.427 --> 16:50.687
[thunderclap]

16:50.767 --> 16:52.607
[chiming]

16:52.687 --> 16:54.227
Thank you.

16:54.307 --> 16:57.937
The truth of it is,
I may hurt you,

16:58.027 --> 16:59.527
and you, me.

16:59.607 --> 17:02.027
But this is the path
that I have chosen.

17:03.617 --> 17:05.487
Would you look at that?

17:05.577 --> 17:08.617
You're stronger now that you've
broken out of your shell.

17:08.697 --> 17:10.907
[clang]

17:10.997 --> 17:13.417
I'm gonna make you cry!

17:13.497 --> 17:17.167
[whoosh]

17:17.247 --> 17:18.837
Hmm.

17:18.917 --> 17:20.127
[growls]

17:20.217 --> 17:22.007
The hell are you smiling about?

17:22.087 --> 17:23.547
Nothing.

17:23.637 --> 17:25.467
Well, I was just thinking,

17:25.547 --> 17:27.847
when I finally return home
from here,

17:27.927 --> 17:31.387
I need to go and challenge
my friend Reinhard.

17:31.477 --> 17:34.687
So, kid, what did
you say your name was?

17:34.767 --> 17:37.017
Julius Juukulius.

17:37.107 --> 17:40.237
Though it is quite
forgettable, I'll remember.

17:40.317 --> 17:41.857
[clang]

17:41.947 --> 17:43.357
[chiming]

17:43.447 --> 17:46.697
[music playing]

17:46.777 --> 17:49.617
♪ ♪

17:49.697 --> 17:51.787
Al Cranvel!

17:51.867 --> 17:53.997
[growls]

17:54.077 --> 17:56.837
- Ready.
- Sure. Whatever.

17:56.917 --> 17:59.377
En garde!

17:59.457 --> 18:00.337
[whoosh]

18:00.417 --> 18:01.837
[clanging]

18:01.917 --> 18:03.797
[grunting]

18:03.877 --> 18:04.797
Ya!

18:04.887 --> 18:06.797
[thud]

18:06.887 --> 18:08.257
[grunting]

18:08.347 --> 18:09.767
[clanging]

18:09.847 --> 18:11.267
Heh.

18:11.347 --> 18:13.177
[clang]

18:13.267 --> 18:15.227
[grunting]

18:15.307 --> 18:16.687
♪ ♪

18:16.767 --> 18:18.107
Ya!

18:18.187 --> 18:19.107
Iku!

18:19.187 --> 18:20.607
[chiming]

18:20.687 --> 18:22.067
[chorus vocalizing]

18:22.147 --> 18:24.067
[cackles]

18:24.147 --> 18:27.027
♪ ♪

18:27.117 --> 18:28.987
[clanging]

18:29.077 --> 18:30.487
[grunting]

18:30.577 --> 18:35.417
♪ ♪

18:35.497 --> 18:37.127
[growls] Ah!

18:37.207 --> 18:39.047
Ia! Aro!

18:39.127 --> 18:40.957
[whoosh]

18:41.047 --> 18:42.667
[rumbling]

18:42.757 --> 18:43.837
[grunts]

18:43.917 --> 18:45.297
[explosion]

18:45.377 --> 18:49.137
♪ ♪

18:49.217 --> 18:50.137
[chiming]

18:50.217 --> 18:51.557
[growls]

18:51.637 --> 18:54.307
Al Clarista!

18:55.887 --> 18:56.937
[clang]

18:57.017 --> 19:01.067
[crumbling]

19:04.897 --> 19:07.737
[cackles]

19:07.817 --> 19:10.277
[clanging]

19:10.367 --> 19:13.157
I am a being who
was born into this world

19:13.237 --> 19:15.077
with no objective.

19:15.157 --> 19:16.957
Why was I born, then?

19:17.037 --> 19:19.037
I don't have an answer.

19:19.127 --> 19:20.377
But--

19:20.457 --> 19:24.877
[music playing]

19:24.957 --> 19:28.177
--do you remember, Ana?

19:28.257 --> 19:31.137
This is where you and I met
for the first time.

19:32.557 --> 19:35.177
You boasted to me about
how greedy you were,

19:35.267 --> 19:37.687
about how you wanted to get
your hands on everything

19:37.767 --> 19:39.557
this world has to offer.

19:39.647 --> 19:41.477
That's why
you're staying here

19:41.567 --> 19:44.067
and refusing to come out,
right?

19:44.147 --> 19:47.357
While you hide here
within your od,

19:47.447 --> 19:50.907
the world outside cannot
reach you or interfere.

19:50.987 --> 19:53.077
If you leave it,
you will be affected

19:53.157 --> 19:55.037
by Gluttony's authority.

19:55.117 --> 19:58.667
In other words,
Julius Juukulius's memory

19:58.747 --> 20:00.917
will be stolen from you.

20:00.997 --> 20:04.337
And that is what scares you.

20:04.417 --> 20:06.667
For a girl who
wants everything,

20:06.757 --> 20:09.757
nothing is as scary
as losing something.

20:09.837 --> 20:13.557
But are you sure
this is what you want?

20:13.637 --> 20:15.347
♪ ♪

20:15.427 --> 20:18.977
[swords clanging]

20:19.057 --> 20:21.517
Are you OK with missing
out on seeing your Knight

20:21.607 --> 20:23.147
at his most gallant?

20:23.227 --> 20:25.437
What a wasted opportunity.

20:25.527 --> 20:28.607
Unbefitting of someone
as stingy as you.

20:28.697 --> 20:29.647
[swords clanging]

20:29.737 --> 20:30.657
[gasps]

20:30.737 --> 20:37.827
♪ ♪

20:40.537 --> 20:41.537
[grunting]

20:41.627 --> 20:45.047
[clanging]

20:47.297 --> 20:49.717
[grunting]

20:49.797 --> 20:51.217
Ah!

20:51.297 --> 20:52.637
Julius!

20:52.717 --> 20:55.967
Go on and show him
what you got, my Knight!

20:56.057 --> 20:57.427
Ah!

20:57.517 --> 20:58.517
Yeah. [cackles]

20:58.597 --> 21:02.017
[clang]

21:02.097 --> 21:03.977
[gasps]

21:04.057 --> 21:05.477
[whoosh]

21:05.567 --> 21:10.027
♪ ♪

21:10.107 --> 21:14.117
[gasping]

21:16.987 --> 21:18.617
Tch.

21:18.697 --> 21:19.247
Ah.

21:20.827 --> 21:24.667
I can't believe this ending
turned out to be so boring.

21:24.747 --> 21:26.337
♪ ♪

21:26.417 --> 21:28.167
[clank]

21:31.507 --> 21:34.217
I guess it was kind of
to be expected.

21:34.297 --> 21:37.177
There isn't another vessel in
existence that could properly

21:37.257 --> 21:39.767
contain this legendary being.

21:39.847 --> 21:41.177
[rumbling]

21:41.267 --> 21:42.597
[cracking]

21:42.687 --> 21:45.107
[JULIUS] You mean
Roy Alphard's body

21:45.187 --> 21:47.317
turned out to be too fragile?

21:47.397 --> 21:50.107
Don't you go getting
the wrong idea, bro.

21:50.187 --> 21:52.357
If I'd been in my own body,
you wouldn't even

21:52.447 --> 21:55.197
be getting close enough
to wipe your snot on me.

21:55.277 --> 21:57.197
Well, I wouldn't do
such a thing anyway.

21:57.277 --> 21:58.157
Hah!

21:58.237 --> 21:59.867
You're no fun.

21:59.947 --> 22:00.997
[cracking]

22:01.077 --> 22:02.827
[rumbling]

22:02.907 --> 22:06.707
Your power has earned
my deepest respect.

22:06.787 --> 22:10.707
I don't need or want to be
some dumb little boy's idol.

22:10.797 --> 22:13.257
I won this fight, Julius.

22:13.337 --> 22:14.677
Uh--

22:17.887 --> 22:19.007
Yes.

22:19.097 --> 22:23.227
Victory belongs to you,
Reid Astria.

22:23.307 --> 22:24.347
Ha!

22:25.307 --> 22:27.357
I like that look on your face.

22:27.437 --> 22:28.977
[cracking]

22:29.067 --> 22:31.357
[growls]

22:31.437 --> 22:33.357
You loser.

22:33.437 --> 22:34.897
[crumbling]

22:34.987 --> 22:38.907
[music playing]

22:38.987 --> 22:45.957
♪ ♪

22:52.627 --> 22:54.297
A pleasure to meet you.

22:54.377 --> 22:55.547
I'm--

22:55.627 --> 22:58.347
my name's
Anastasia Hoshin.

22:58.427 --> 23:00.307
I want everything
this world has to offer.

23:01.767 --> 23:05.557
So, you incredibly good-looking
man, what's your name?

23:05.637 --> 23:07.227
Right.

23:09.317 --> 23:11.857
My name is Julius Juukulius,

23:11.937 --> 23:14.737
your Number One Knight.

23:14.817 --> 23:17.777
You may not remember,
but see,

23:17.867 --> 23:20.617
I dedicated my sword
to you alone.

23:20.697 --> 23:24.497
And I am here to give
all my strength to you,

23:24.577 --> 23:26.957
as well as support
your ambition.

23:27.037 --> 23:28.207
Oh, yeah?

23:28.287 --> 23:30.337
I don't really
remember any of that.

23:30.417 --> 23:32.667
But you know,

23:32.747 --> 23:35.377
I only needed
one look at you,

23:35.467 --> 23:39.177
and then I knew that
I needed to make you mine.

23:42.717 --> 23:47.017
[panting]

23:47.097 --> 23:47.977
I'm out.

23:48.057 --> 23:48.977
Huh?

23:49.057 --> 23:50.227
[wind blowing]

23:50.307 --> 23:53.277
The first floor
is actually outside?

23:54.477 --> 23:55.397
Oh, wow.

23:55.487 --> 23:57.357
It's above the clouds.

23:57.447 --> 24:02.527
[wind blowing]

24:05.117 --> 24:06.287
Oh.

24:06.367 --> 24:08.867
Oh, wait. You're--

24:09.957 --> 24:12.587
Greetings,
thou who hath reached

24:12.667 --> 24:16.257
the tower's summit,
almighty petitioner who hath

24:16.337 --> 24:18.337
set foot upon the first floor.

24:19.837 --> 24:21.887
I am Volcanica.

24:21.967 --> 24:24.767
In accordance with
the ancient covenant,

24:24.847 --> 24:29.017
I ask the will of the one
who hath reached the summit.
